{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20768","headline":"自君之出矣 · 卢仝","name":"自君之出矣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自君之出矣，壁上蜘蛛织。\n近取见妾心，夜夜无休息。\n妾有双玉环，寄君表相忆。\n环是妾之心，玉是君之德。\n驰情增悴容，蓄思损精力。\n玉簟寒凄凄，延想心恻恻。\n风含霜月明，水泛碧天色。\n此水有尽时，此情无终极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}